      "statusChangeID": "67ed8096c621acd0d6c3b35c",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Instances have a maximum age of 7 days. Last year additional functionality was added to reset existing instances earlier than this after updates to the realtime networking servers went out, the minimum time in which of is effectively 8 hours in the worst case scenario where the instance is opened right before the update. So far both systems time limits have not changed since they was introduced.\n\nEarlier this week a deploy was performed where the latest version was set to have this reduced reset time, this a precautionary measure (sometimes things only go wrong when rolled out at scale), after a short time it was meant to be returned to normal however was not. At time of writing it has now been returned to normal and means instances should stick around for their appropriate lifespan.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
