      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{667353ba8663454809d39116|full_name}:\n\nAdding a custom message for instances that are closing earlier than normal would likely help a lot to prevent this issue from being reported every time server-side updates take place multiple days in a row. For example saying \"this instance will reset in 1 hour due to important server issues, sorry for the inconvenience\" would clearly indicate to players that it is not just a normal thing and that there is a reason for it closing early.\n\nIf you want to help players that want long lasting instances, maybe there could be more warning too, like at 4 hours, 3 hours, and 2 hours remaining.\n\nShould I just make a feature quest for this?",
