      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{610d538d5303a82960a415b4|full_name}: The issue reported here was the reduced time accidentally being left set for 2 days of which has been fixed. So indeed please create a feature request post for any desire to change the system. A third warning before instance reset (lets say at the 3 hour mark) is a fair ask though so next time so I'll see if I can get that out whenever other future changes go out.",
