  "details": "Currently, instances are reset about 8 hours after world instances are created.\n\nThis is very inconvenient as world gimmicks, etc. are reset prematurely.\n\nIs it possible to make it so that they are retained for at least 24 hours?\n\nAlso, it says that when the server is updated, it resets after 8 hours, but I would like to be notified that it resets when I join a world or when I create an instance.",
